GarageJam 8.0.1 - 2026-10-19
============================

Stable Release

GarageJam 8.0.0 — 2026-10-10
============================

A new multitrack recording studio written in C with GTK 4, libadwaita
and GStreamer, built with GNU Autotools.

* Multitrack recording with overdub: arm a track, press record, and
  play along with the existing tracks
* Live mixer: per-track volume, pan, mute and solo, all adjustable
  while playing
* Waveform timeline with click-to-seek and live waveform while recording
* Input and output peak meters
* Import audio files of any format GStreamer can decode
* Export a 16-bit PCM WAV mixdown, from the app or headless:
    garagejam --export-mixdown=jam.gjxml --output=jam.wav
* Projects saved as GarageJam XML (.gjxml), see doc/gjxml.md;
  numbers are written locale-independently
* Unsaved-changes prompt, keyboard shortcuts, AppStream metadata,
  MIME type for .gjxml, man page
* Unit tests for GJXML and the WAV peak reader (make check)

Requirements: GLib 2.76, GTK 4.12, libadwaita 1.5, GStreamer 1.20 with
the base and good plugin sets.
